  unitName: Thunder Idol
  unitId: 40132
  unitNumber: 186
  description: Worshipers of thunder gave this miraculous idol life through prayer.
    It's often spoken of in popular adventure tales. Adventurers in the search of
    treasure at ancient ruins are often thwarted by electricity it shoots from its
    stone mouth. Today it continues to hinder the desires of summoners seeking the
    ability to awaken mysterious inherent powers.
  summonDesc: I am a Thunder Idol.<br>Seems you understand me.<br>Well then, I'll
    follow you.
